   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Counting and saying ages",
     "texto": [
      "In Bokmål, the modern forms of numbers are normally used: the tens first and then the unit, written as one word, just as in English «twenty-one»: **tjueen** (21), **tjueto** (22), **trettito** (32). Here we will follow that order. The inverted form may appear in old or conservative uses, but it is not the model of written Bokmål in this unit.",
      "When giving your age, keep the order **er + number + år**: **Jeg er trettito år**. Bokmålsordboka lists **sju** and **syv**; in this course we will use **sju**. For 20 and 30 we will use **tjue** and **tretti** consistently."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
